rooms_desc ({"You have just stepped into Slazenger's beautiful home. You are standingin the hall. All you notice is the marble floor, and Slazenger's DalmationTheo who greets you nicely.","You have just entered the family room. You quickly notice the beautifulwhite leather couches on either side of the room. They look very comfortableand you can't wait to try them out. There is also a leather loveseat whichis also white. But don't try to sit in the loveseat, that's Theo's seat!The rest of the room is pretty typical, shiny hardwood floors, a bigfireplace, a big screen T.V., with the Playboy channel and a big stereo rests over in the corner of the room.","This is Slazenger's bedroom. As you enter you notice Theo is lying down inhis favorite spot, on Slazenger's bed. This is a good sized room, with aking sized bed and the common things you would find in a bedroom such asa dresser, desk etc. Everything in this room is black or white whichis peculiar yet interesting. You also notice the T.V. against the west wallwhich is tuned to the Playboy channel.","This is the game room. It is just a plain room, and the only thing thatcomes to your attention is the huge pool table in the center of the room.There is also a gumball machine over in the corner of the room.","This is the beautiful patio area. The first thing that grabs yourattention is the huge heated pool, with slides and a diving board. Thepool is perfectly clean and you can't wait to jump in. There are manyloungechairs surrounding the pool where you can pick up some ray's if you wish. Over against the house is a little bar, where you can fix yourself a drink, (you'll never see Slazenger over there because he's tooyoung to drink). The last thing you notice is a little sign over by the pool which says, \"Skinny dipping only!!\".","You are now standing in Slazenger's den. Here you see Slazenger's awesomecomputer, which is sitting on a huge black desk. In front of the desk isSlazenger's big black leather computer chair. ",0,0,0,0,})
